  "description": "Erection of 1st, 2nd and 3rd floor front extensions, erection of ground, 1st, 2nd and 3rd floor rear extensions and internal alterations including provision of a mezzanine floor above ground floor at rear. Change of use of the upper floors to Use Class C3 to provide 5 self-contained residential units.",
  "subdivision_of_building": null,
  "actual_completion_date": null,
  "lpa_app_no": "2024/1171",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "application_type_full": "Full planning permission",
  "last_updated_by": "Portal",
